Source structures are drawn from the Materials Project, which distributes its
data under CC BY 4.0. Attribution to the Materials Project is required for any
reuse of the structural data, in addition to attribution to this work.

External collective-evaluation structures come from the Materials Cloud
three-dimensional structure database (MC3D), PBE-v1. Credit the dataset authors
and retain the upstream CC BY 4.0 attribution with reused source structures.
Dataset record: https://archive.materialscloud.org/records/szjaf-cfv74
Source endpoint: https://optimade.materialscloud.org/main/mc3d-pbe-v1/
